{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 108, "line_no": 4, "text": "三、关于人类起源的进化意识", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 402, "w": 511, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "三、关于人类起源的进化意识", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 402, "w": 511, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 108, "line_no": 5, "text": "基督教关于上帝造人的神话统治了欧洲几千年，而早在远古时期，中华各民族就猜", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 463, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "基督教关于上帝造人的神话统治了欧洲几千年，而早在远古时期，中华各民族就猜", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 463, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 108, "line_no": 6, "text": "测到了宇宙万物都是不断进化而来的。然而，达尔文的生物进化论能够打破基督教的迷", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 527, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "测到了宇宙万物都是不断进化而来的。然而，达尔文的生物进化论能够打破基督教的迷", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 527, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 108, "line_no": 7, "text": "梦，最根本的就是进化论以科学和实证作为基础，而中华各民族的进化意识却大致停留", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 591, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "梦，最根本的就是进化论以科学和实证作为基础，而中华各民族的进化意识却大致停留", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 591, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 108, "line_no": 8, "text": "在直观和猜想的层面上，这是古代中国的文化发展路向不同于西方所致。", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 660, "w": 1270, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在直观和猜想的层面上，这是古代中国的文化发展路向不同于西方所致。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 660, "w": 1270, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 108, "line_no": 9, "text": "布依族先民对于人类起源的问题，也作了朴素的探索和思考。《古歌•造万物》记载", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 724, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族先民对于人类起源的问题，也作了朴素的探索和思考。《古歌•造万物》记载", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 724, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 108, "line_no": 10, "text": "了布依族先民对于人类起源的朴素猜想，古歌说：", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 789, "w": 856, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "了布依族先民对于人类起源的朴素猜想，古歌说：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 789, "w": 856, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 108, "line_no": 11, "text": "天地形成后，", "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 857, "w": 229, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "天地形成后，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 857, "w": 229, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
